{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_027say01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_027say01_title", "source_sha256": "45d09f4718309d28c43c2077db1d0293f26b226aced99750cf16b22b8805a468", "ja": "紗代子とおでかけ1", "zh": "和纱代子出游1", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_027say01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_027say01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "aabde7172300ca65560a96c201752768194d44285b617079c0ced4b1d5d84cf6", "ja": "紗代子とおでかけした一幕です。", "zh": "这是和纱代子一起出门时的一幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_027say01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_027say01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "712c107ebe3f588c2f5ef44d24c91dda8ebb31eb52296685984edac85b31ff69", "ja": "（今日は富士山が見える遊園地でのイベント！\n紗代子も、だいぶ気合いが入ってるみたいだな）", "zh": "（今天是在能看到富士山的游乐园举办活动！纱代子好像也干劲十足啊）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_027say01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_027say01_1001_027say", "source_sha256": "50cd930a60ca12366c3390a8c2161fc8616a4b0ed3b1b8f73ba4183963aa5d95", "ja": "{$P$}！　今日は、\n絶対にすごいイベントにしてみせますよ！", "zh": "{$P$}！今天一定会把活动办得非常精彩！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_027say01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_027say01_1002_p", "source_sha256": "da109c5c51ab2dda7ac67cd4a6f28e50478c9eabe7cf1d216ab4414d8beb0c92", "ja": "ああ。期待してるぞ！", "zh": "啊，我很期待哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_027say01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_027say01_1003_027say", "source_sha256": "06e8f4f7810bf716cf975b350802d840e30d44514f572871814d1196e7b016d9", "ja": "特に、あのコーナー……\n『アイドルが絶叫マシンに乗ってみた』……！", "zh": "尤其是那个环节……\n《偶像挑战惊险刺激的游乐设施》……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_027say01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_027say01_1004_p", "source_sha256": "03cc790f1eb88662ae55666e612b379f76ad5778883d5b5a801f2fb82a22daa4", "ja": "そうだな！　……あれ？\n紗代子、絶叫マシンは苦手だったか？", "zh": "是啊！……咦？\n紗代子，你不擅长坐刺激的游乐设施吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_027say01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_027say01_1005_027say", "source_sha256": "7bd9a7a1a8ccc1c6c24db83da313c6587fb93c1f9986ab6ef4cf30f9975910ce", "ja": "いえっ、そんなことないです！\nジェットコースターは、嫌いじゃないんです。", "zh": "没有，没有那回事！\n我并不讨厌过山车。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_027say01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_027say01_1006_027say", "source_sha256": "dfc24ec0f1159429277017a66015de2112efbd6ebd203fe917c38357811baeab", "ja": "けど、ここのコースターはすごく……その、\nすごいんだって、恵美ちゃんに聞いたので……。", "zh": "可是，我听惠美说，这里的过山车特别……那个，特别刺激……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_027say01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_027say01_1007_p", "source_sha256": "3e7f64b3624e43a74dbac0e0cf4da71c77215f14ec553d26cb87782b90041f8c", "ja": "そ、そうか。無理そうなら、スタッフさんに相談して、\n別の乗り物にしてもらう事もできると思うけど……。", "zh": "这、这样啊。如果觉得不行的话，可以去和工作人员商量，应该也能换成其他游乐设施……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_027say01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_027say01_1008_027say", "source_sha256": "af2f3dc4da7b3547c2ebf4707804ea61454bbb60eafe411fad34c5b87f6ab537", "ja": "大丈夫です！　イメトレもばっちりしてきたし……\nそれに、この程度の困難に負ける私じゃありません！", "zh": "没关系的！意象训练我已经做得很充分了……\n而且，我可不是会被这种程度的困难打倒的人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_027say01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_027say01_1009_p", "source_sha256": "3eb6f057983a1d661591316a1e3740d0f9374c0644ea25ea1870cc0961ed6fb6", "ja": "そ、そうか……とはいえ、本当に無理そうだったら、\n直前でもいいから言ってくれ。約束だぞ。", "zh": "这、这样啊……不过，要是真的觉得不行，就算临到最后也要告诉我。答应我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_027say01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_027say01_1010_027say", "source_sha256": "1d9cd401accc3291928796b7d56a85e488df3fc8804bb9cc7829ca218bc12029", "ja": "{$P$}……はいっ！", "zh": "{$P$}……好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_027say01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_027say01_1011_027say", "source_sha256": "4fbb376ec86472d48e4503e016d6a3b043f3c670de91809a72de6a9a4c989f47", "ja": "はぁ、はぁ……。やった……やりました！\n絶叫マシンチャレンジ、制覇しました！", "zh": "呼、呼……太好了……成功了……！\n尖叫系游乐设施挑战，通关了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_027say01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_027say01_1012_027say", "source_sha256": "58760361fcce6a45fd02e9d3d989ba44d42b5370c671b73ea25eecf3e91dd6e1", "ja": "{$P$}の応援のおかげで、\n私、またひとつ限界を超えられた気がしますっ！", "zh": "多亏了{$P$}的加油打气，\n我觉得自己好像又突破了一次极限！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_027say01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_027say01_1013_p", "source_sha256": "48e0891bb544bac9be295540510688aa76315bab6664c5bcb05e02069c5bb238", "ja": "（絶叫マシンへの挑戦を、紗代子は持ち前の\n根性でやり遂げた……流石だぞ、紗代子！）", "zh": "（纱代子凭借与生俱来的毅力，完成了挑战惊险刺激的游乐设施……不愧是你啊，纱代子！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
